[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633817114","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102403#issuecomment-2633817114","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102403","id":2633817114,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c_Nwa","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T12:51:18Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T12:51:18Z","body":"I'm not sure this is a bug as such, setting the cursor every frame doesn't seem proper\n\nCan you try what happens if you change it only when the state changes?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633817114/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633865756","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102403#issuecomment-2633865756","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102403","id":2633865756,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c_Zoc","user":{"login":"Chubercik","id":37378746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3Mzc4NzQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37378746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik","html_url":"https://github.com/Chubercik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T13:12:39Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T13:12:39Z","body":"I thought that might be the case too - even so, I don't think current behavior is what should happen.\n\nI'll try not changing the icon every frame later today and report back with the results.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633865756/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634002736","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102403#issuecomment-2634002736","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102403","id":2634002736,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c_7Ew","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T13:42:24Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T13:42:24Z","body":"Can you also test with [4.4.beta2](https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-4-beta-2/) to see if this happens there as well?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634002736/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634766394","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102403#issuecomment-2634766394","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102403","id":2634766394,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dC1g6","user":{"login":"Chubercik","id":37378746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3Mzc4NzQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37378746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik","html_url":"https://github.com/Chubercik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T18:35:35Z","updated_at":"2025-02-26T11:55:55Z","body":"Alright, I'm back.\n\nIn the version I used (v4.3.stable.steam [77dcf97d8]) changing the script, so that `set_custom_mouse_cursor()` isn't invoked every frame, does fix the issue.\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nconst TIP_LOC = Vector2(11, 6)\n\nvar cursor = load(\"res://sprites/cursor.png\")\nvar cursor_click = load(\"res://sprites/cursor_click.png\")\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tInput.set_custom_mouse_cursor(cursor, Input.CURSOR_ARROW, TIP_LOC)\n\n\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n\tif Input.is_action_just_pressed(\"clicked\"):\n\t\tInput.set_custom_mouse_cursor(cursor_click, Input.CURSOR_ARROW, TIP_LOC)\n\telif Input.is_action_just_released(\"clicked\"):\n\t\tInput.set_custom_mouse_cursor(cursor, Input.CURSOR_ARROW, TIP_LOC)\n```\n\n(would've done that in the first place [had there been a `is_mouse_button_just_released()` method](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2016) 👀)\n\nHowever, I still think the current cursor behaviour in web builds is out of place (no parity with desktop builds) and should be investigated.\n\nChecked it out on version v4.4.beta2.official [a013481b0], the issue is still present there.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634766394/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2675447449","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102403#issuecomment-2675447449","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102403","id":2675447449,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6feBaZ","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-21T20:08:55Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T20:08:55Z","body":"Is this a regression? Since which version does it occurs?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2675447449/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2675454708","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102403#issuecomment-2675454708","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102403","id":2675454708,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6feDL0","user":{"login":"Chubercik","id":37378746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3Mzc4NzQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37378746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik","html_url":"https://github.com/Chubercik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-21T20:13:23Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T20:13:23Z","body":"> Is this a regression? Since which version does it occurs?\n\nDon't think it is, though I haven't tested any pre-4.3 versions, only `4.3.stable`, `4.4.beta2` and `4.4.beta4`.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2675454708/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2975476170","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102403#issuecomment-2975476170","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102403","id":2975476170,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xWinK","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T07:55:38Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T09:22:33Z","body":"> In the version I used (v4.3.stable.steam [[77dcf97](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/77dcf97d82cbfe4e4615475fa52ca03da645dbd8)]) changing the script, so that `set_custom_mouse_cursor()` isn't invoked every frame, does fix the issue.\n\nBut your code is actually invoked every frame. Every frame, `set_custom_mouse_cursor()` is called, whether the mouse state changed or not. \n\n> (would've done that in the first place [had there been a `is_mouse_button_just_released()` method](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2016) 👀)\n\nNo need for this. You just need something like this:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nconst TIP_LOCATION = Vector2i(11, 6)\nconst CURSOR = preload(\"res://cursor.png\")\nconst CURSOR_CLICK = preload(\"res://cursor_click.png\")\n\n# Called when the node enters the scene tree for the first time.\nfunc _ready():\n\t_update_cursor()\n\n\n# Called every frame. 'delta' is the elapsed time since the previous frame.\nfunc _input(event):\n\tif event is InputEventMouseButton:\n\t\t_update_cursor(event.pressed)\n\n\nfunc _update_cursor(clicked: = false) -> void:\n\tvar cursor: = CURSOR\n\n\tif clicked:\n\t\tcursor = CURSOR_CLICK\n\n\tInput.set_custom_mouse_cursor(cursor, Input.CURSOR_ARROW, TIP_LOCATION)\n\n```\n\nI created an MRP with this code. Here it is: [102403.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20752500/102403.zip)\n\nThe result is not as bad as setting the cursor each frame, but it does exhibit some inconsistencies. (Edit: only on Safari and Firefox, seems alright on Chrome)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2975476170/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]